# Traductions anglaises des récits de mariages (slug -> données)
EN = {
"marie-charles-mariage-2025-lovely-day-event": dict(
 head="Château Pontac Lynch, 4 October 2025",
 story="<p>On 4 October 2025, Marie and Charles celebrated their wedding at Château Pontac Lynch, surrounded by 80 guests, in a retro English boudoir atmosphere: chic and full of character. Every detail told their story, from coasters personalised with their initials to a vinyl bar setting the rhythm of the cocktail hour, and even a watercolour artist offering each guest a unique portrait as a keepsake. Surprises were part of the day too, with spectacular daytime fireworks and giant Olympic-style caricature heads bringing a playful, festive touch. The generous, delicious dinner won over every guest. Despite mixed weather, the atmosphere was magical, warm and joyful: a wedding just like them, elegant and daring.</p>",
 quote="Wedding gem!! Alexandra is an incredible wedding planner. She is there throughout the preparations, answers every request (whatever it may be), understands every wish, is always available and seeks only, with enthusiasm, joy and devotion, to bring the couple's wishes to life. We hired her to plan our wedding and it was the best decision we made: she handled everything from start to finish, never counting her time. Her approach is very well thought out, and she gets to know you, your world, your wishes and expectations before orchestrating the long-awaited day. On the day we were amazed by all the work done and by the decor, which matched our moodboard perfectly. She is present yet discreet. Her presence is reassuring, she made herself indispensable (and handled every hitch brilliantly!). Meeting Alexandra was above all a wonderful human encounter: we recommend her without hesitation. Alexandra is kind, efficient, organised, smiling, attentive, professional and simply wonderful 🥰"),
"alexandra-clement-mariage-2025": dict(
 head="Domaine de la Dame Blanche, Grignols · 2025",
 story="<p>Alexandra &amp; Clément imagined a wedding that was truly theirs: elegant, vintage, in mocha tones and, above all, full of surprises. At Domaine de la Dame Blanche in Grignols, surrounded by 100 loved ones, every moment had its own flavour.</p><p>It all began with an overwhelming civil ceremony: the bride's father, mayor of the village, married his daughter where it all began. A suspended moment, full of love and pride.</p><p>Then came the mystery… Guests did not know the reception venue until the day itself. You either followed the couple or hopped on the shuttle. And then: the wow effect. Total surprise, and smiles all round.</p><p>The party flowed without pause: group photos full of laughter, with personalised labels and guests called by country names, a gift bar designed as one more thoughtful touch, and a main-course service turned into a real show, with music, energy and sparklers in the room.</p><p>The night went up a notch with a live band, wild best men tossing the groom into the air, and a bartender in rhythm serving signature cocktails created by Alexandra and Clément.</p><p>A vibrant, generous wedding, full of love and joyful madness. Powerful, genuine and truly unforgettable memories.</p>",
 quote=""),
"alicia-alexandre-mariage-2025": dict(
 head="Collines d'Iduki, Basque Country · June 2025",
 story="<p>In June 2025, Alicia and Alexandre imagined a wedding devoted to family and friends, designed as an intimate, timeless moment. Nature everywhere, plays of light, candles and green tones created a warm, cosy and enveloping atmosphere: a true bubble of happiness. Their religious ceremony, both moving and festive, carried by a gospel choir, made every heart sing: LOVE was everywhere. Every detail was carefully considered and, with 23 suppliers to coordinate, this once-in-a-lifetime event took on its full meaning. Outstanding service, sublime decor and intense moments of sharing created wild, magical and unforgettable memories.</p>",
 quote="Magnificent! Want a “wow” effect for you and your guests? Look no further, you are in the right place. Your tastes are studied in depth beforehand to hit the bullseye. Alexandra keeps up with the latest decor trends, finds the best suppliers for the set-up and has the eye for detail that makes all the difference. We had a scenography that truly reflected us, thanks to the many inspirations she showed us. A design book was created, which became our reference when talking to florists and furniture rental companies. We highly recommend Alexandra: communication was seamless in achieving our goals around our theme. Thank you!"),
"yvonne-thomas-mariage-2025": dict(
 head="Château Belle Époque, Landes · 6 September 2025",
 story="<p>In September 2025, Yvonne &amp; Thomas, a Franco-German couple, crossed France to celebrate their union at Château Belle Époque, in the Landes. Conceived as a timeless interlude, their wedding unfolded over four days in an atmosphere that was elegant, convivial and deeply human. The pared-back, elegant art direction left plenty of room for meaning and emotion, at the heart of a truly international celebration. Each day came to life in carefully chosen places: from a traditional Landes hall to a beachfront restaurant, from a dinner under a glass roof to a brunch by the pool. Guests lived an intense, sincere experience, and the couple savoured every moment, fully present.</p>",
 quote="Alexandra was far more than a wedding organiser: thanks to her calm, her kindness and her great professionalism, she allowed us to live our day to the full, without stress, enjoying every moment. Her taste and eye for detail made all the difference, and we are deeply grateful to have had her by our side. The memories of that day remain incredibly strong, and the result is magnificent. We recommend her without hesitation."),
"mariagecolorealaplage": dict(
 head="La Ferme d'en Chon · 1 June 2024",
 story="<p>We never tire of reliving this colourful wedding at La Ferme d'en Chon! A day as sparkling as it was elegant, carried by a voluptuous gown, refined decor inspired by Vietnam (the country where the couple met 🏮) and a few original touches such as a burrata bar that delighted the guests. It all ended with a magical photo session on the beach, in the heart of the Landes, between golden light and sea breeze. A suspended moment, full of love and authenticity.</p>",
 quote="Alexandra is impressive: smiling, creative, with extraordinary energy and above all very organised. We were blown away by everything she achieved for our wedding. Alexandra guided us for several months, helped us choose suppliers who matched us, advised us and listened until the very last minute. On the day, she ran the organisation masterfully and we enjoyed our wedding 150% thanks to her. The decor of the reception and the cocktail hour exceeded our expectations, and the entertainment was perfect too. Alexandra also won over our families, for whom she was a point of contact as well. You can trust her completely; choosing her was one of our best decisions."),
"caroline-jackson": dict(
 head="Domaine de Cap'Bat · 22 July 2023",
 story="<p>They are beautiful… beautiful in friendship, in love, in generosity and in humour. A radiant couple! Love and union were their priority. After an intimate ceremony at the town hall, they returned to Domaine de Cap'Bat for a deeply moving celebrant-led ceremony: their story revealed, love everywhere and laughter shared!</p><p>That weekend, Mont-de-Marsan was celebrating the Fêtes de la Madeleine, and the festival echoed through the wedding: blue bandanas, traditional music and a party until dawn. Together, the couple celebrated a new chapter of their life.</p>",
 quote="We recommend her 1000%. It has been almost three weeks since our wedding, this beautiful adventure alongside Alexandra, came to an end. More than a wedding planner, Alexandra was a shoulder, a confidante, an unwavering support we could count on throughout the months of preparation. The closer the day came, the higher the pressure, and the more she fulfilled her essential role with kindness and simplicity. Alexandra masters every step of planning a wedding: research, contacts, coordination, negotiation, decor, staging… and does it all with a smile and humility. She is a true gem we recommend without hesitation! Her professional and personal qualities will let you enjoy the most beautiful day of your life fully and serenely. Thank you so much."),
"jennifer-laurent": dict(
 head="Château de Garde · 27 May 2023",
 story="<p>After a <strong>proposal</strong> on a small beach near the tip of Cap Ferret, facing the Dune du Pilat, Jennifer and Laurent celebrated their wedding at the magnificent <strong>Château de Garde</strong> in Moulon.</p><p>The moment they had long awaited was the <strong>exchange of rings</strong> at church. The blessing was gentle and solemn; with violinists and an opera singer, the ceremony was particularly moving. Then off to the château in a beautiful convertible for an evening full of <strong>flavours and music</strong>.</p><p>Guests enjoyed a saxophonist and unique culinary experiences among the vines and by the pool. The atmosphere and the exceptional setting gave the couple exactly the energy they hoped for! Soft, amber lights were perfect to highlight their <strong>love</strong> and the warmth of this wedding.</p>",
 quote="Alexandra is the rare gem you need to plan and live your wedding! With her professionalism, her listening and her kindness, she was a shoulder to lean on during our preparations and on the day itself, which was exceptional thanks to her. She advised us at every step, and what lovely moments we spent with her during our meetings! Don't hesitate to call on Alexandra of Lovely Day Event to plan your wedding. She is magic!"),
"marie-martin": dict(
 head="Château d'Arche · 17 July 2021",
 story="<p>Under the brilliant sun of 17 July 2021, Marie and Martin, two adopted Frenchies, were married near the vineyards of Château d'Arche in Sauternes, <strong>in Gironde</strong>. A day they will never forget…</p><p>The two lovebirds, who cannot take their eyes off each other, met during their studies and have never been apart since. Bringing together everyone they love to <strong>celebrate their wedding</strong> in France was an obvious choice.</p><p>Marie and Martin chose a <strong>religious ceremony</strong> to exchange their vows before God. Then came the celebrations, a point of honour for these two bon vivants, in a bespoke setting that reflected them: <strong>romantic and industrial</strong>. They pulled out all the stops: sunset over the vines, a starry sky, views over the wine cellars… and their parents' surprise, a <strong>fire and LED show</strong> by a fire juggler!</p>",
 quote="We asked Alexandra to plan our wedding from A to Z. Alexandra is organised, available, honest, attentive, full of good advice, resourceful and a skilled negotiator; she will make your wedding her personal mission! From the preparations to the end of the festivities, including the brunch, everything ran like clockwork. We didn't have to worry about a thing, which let us make the most of our guests and the party. Alexandra created a wedding exactly like us, just as we had imagined it. You can trust her with your eyes closed; she is the perfect wedding planner, we could not have dreamed of better. Alex, thank you so much for everything you did to make this day unforgettable!"),
"mai-rufus": dict(
 head="Domaine de Conseillant · 25 June 2022",
 story="<p>Two hearts, one soul: on 25 June 2022, Maï and Rufus said “I do” in Gironde. Their <strong>celebrant-led ceremony</strong> took place, full of joy and emotion, at Domaine de Conseillant in Cubzac-les-Ponts.</p><p>With a romantic <strong>bohemian theme</strong>, their bond was palpable throughout this intense day. Beneath orchids, pampas grass and a very pared-back style, more than a hundred guests laughed, cried, danced and loved. Thanks to our <strong>trusted suppliers</strong>, we made their dream come true: becoming husband and wife!</p>",
 quote="Alexandra took care of the decor and coordination of our wedding. She was a great support, full of good advice and truly attentive to our wishes and budget. Thanks to her experience, she thinks of every detail and knows what she is talking about. You can't imagine the amount of work behind a wedding, so don't hesitate to hire a coordinator for the day. The decor is as meticulous as it is beautiful! She made sure our wedding went exactly as we had dreamed. Thank you again Alexandra! Go for it, she's the best!"),
"marion-charles": dict(
 head="Château Larrivet Haut-Brion · May 2022",
 story="<p>In May 2022, Marion &amp; Charles said “I do” for the rest of their lives! A <strong>chic and bohemian</strong> wedding, colourful and refined: everything we love…</p><p>A day rooted in <strong>tradition</strong>, and more! After getting ready at <strong>Les Sources de Caudalie</strong>, Marion &amp; Charles were married at the town hall of <strong>Arcachon</strong>, before promising love and faithfulness before God. They then welcomed their guests at <strong>Château Larrivet Haut-Brion</strong> to begin the celebrations…</p><p>A day full of <strong>laughter</strong>, <strong>tears</strong> and <strong>emotion</strong>. What a day!</p>",
 quote="Alex organised a dream wedding for us! Thank you again for your patience and kindness. We were so lucky to have you with us for our wedding 💕"),
"melissa-sebastien-boheme-mariafe": dict(
 head="Domaine Le Herre · 6 August 2022",
 story="<p>Mélissa &amp; Sébastien travelled from afar to <strong>be with their family</strong> and marry at <strong>Domaine Le Herre</strong> on 6 August 2022. The light, the warmth, the atmosphere, the setting, the decor… I could go on forever describing this sumptuous <strong>bohemian wedding</strong> in <strong>terracotta</strong>, <strong>blue</strong> and rustic wood.</p><p>On this special day the couple put the emphasis on <strong>family</strong>, the <strong>exchange of rings</strong> and the celebrations, and I believe the challenge was met with flying colours! Discover the photographs of this sumptuous wedding…</p>",
 quote="Living abroad, we absolutely needed a wedding planner. But how do you choose? You are entrusting one of the most beautiful days of your life to someone you don't know. So we went with our feelings. After several video calls with different planners, we chose Alexandra. What a great choice!!!! Alexandra is kindness itself. She is patient, attentive and efficient. She organised the wedding we had dreamed of. She was always available to guide us, inform us and reassure us. She is also an excellent decorator. In short, you can entrust your wedding to Alexandra with your eyes closed; we can assure you that you won't be disappointed. Thank you again Alexandra."),
"charlotte-arnaud": dict(
 head="Latresne · 18 June 2022",
 story="<p>Arnaud and Charlotte celebrated their <strong>union</strong> at home. Sharing the same name meant a great deal to them, for all their personal and professional plans.</p><p>So we prepared a <strong>very intimate wedding</strong>. What mattered most to them was a bespoke meal and beautiful <strong>decor</strong> in pastel, wood and gold tones. Everything we love: that <strong>delicate, refined</strong> feel!</p><p>This couple showed and gave us so much love. And you? Would you love a <strong>small, unique</strong> wedding?</p>",
 quote="We are only just coming down from cloud nine: 18 June was magical! A huge thank you to Alexandra, it was perfect. We never expected to enjoy the day so much; everyone loved the decor, the suppliers, the organisation and more. So happy to have come across Lovely Day Event a few months ago! Thank you again Alexandra for making this day our perfect wedding!"),
"delphine-haythem": dict(
 head="Villa La Tosca, Arcachon Bay · 9 October 2021",
 story="<p><strong>On-the-day coordination</strong>? Of course: I also take care of just that part if you have handled everything before. Delphine &amp; Haythem planned their <strong>chic wedding</strong> masterfully, in the middle of Covid and postponements, so the celebration was eagerly awaited.</p><p>This wedding at <strong>Villa La Tosca</strong>, on the <strong>Arcachon Bay</strong>, famous for its <strong>waterfront</strong> setting and lush gardens, offers so many spaces and unique moments. A little corner of paradise!</p><p>Do you love <strong>authentic weddings</strong> too? Picture a private villa with luxurious suites for getting ready, a welcome drink by the infinity pool, an exclusive <strong>celebrant-led ceremony</strong> on the beach, cocktails in the warm park and <strong>dinner</strong> under the stars.</p>",
 quote="An indispensable ally! “Enjoy it, because the day goes by so fast.” Those words took on their full meaning on our wedding day, because we were serene. Entrusting our wedding coordination to Alexandra was the key to our peace of mind. From our first meeting we knew she was the right person. Alexandra is dynamic and full of ideas thanks to her great experience. She is reassuring and knows how to manage the delicate schedule of a wedding, even during a pandemic. Smiling, radiant and attentive, she was our lifeline through that uncertain Covid period, always bouncing back and being there for us, even when we had to postpone our date. Her excellent relationships with suppliers built a true team around our wedding. Beyond a wedding planner, we met a wonderful person who listened, advised and reassured us throughout the preparations and on the day. Thank you Alexandra, and your team, for your help, advice and kindness, your professionalism, creativity, good humour, and above all your presence from dawn! We lived the most beautiful day of our lives thanks to you. Looking for the best wedding planner for the great adventure of marriage? Look no further, you have found her!"),
"emilie-aurelien": dict(
 head="La Chartreuse des Eyres · 3 July 2021",
 story="<p>Under the brilliant <strong>sun</strong> of <strong>3 July 2021</strong>, <strong>Emilie and Aurélien</strong> were married. After a civil ceremony the day before at the town hall of Léognan and a reunion with their loved ones, they invited everyone to <strong>Domaine de la Chartreuse des Eyres</strong> for a packed day! At the couple's request, the estate was decorated in a <strong>countryside, natural</strong> spirit.</p><p>On the programme: <strong>getting ready in the estate's beautiful rooms</strong>, then a <strong>ceremony</strong> punctuated by <strong>meaningful rituals</strong> such as the wine bottle ritual and a group song. And then… you know the rest! <strong>Celebrations</strong> with a wild dance floor until the end of the night!</p>",
 quote="Alexandra accompanied us from the start of our project until it came to life on the day. Very creative and always full of good advice, she guided us through our choices. Surrounded by the best suppliers, she advised us while respecting our tastes and budget. To enjoy this day to the full, I can only recommend calling on her talent."),
"delphine-ludovic": dict(
 head="Domaine d'Arès · 10 July 2021",
 story="<p><strong>New parents</strong> of a one-month-old baby, marrying was obvious for Delphine &amp; Ludovic: a way to <strong>bring their family together</strong>!</p><p>Travelling from <strong>Lille</strong> to marry in Delphine's home region, they gathered their closest family on the <strong>Friday</strong> for the <strong>civil ceremony at the town hall of Le Bouscat</strong> and a first reunion dinner, before saying “I do” on <strong>Saturday 10 July</strong> in a <strong>deeply emotional celebrant-led ceremony</strong>. Tears dried, the celebrations began! An <strong>epicurean evening</strong> outdoors under the stars. A magical, timeless moment. Two wholehearted, kind and generous people. I have no words for Delphine &amp; Ludovic's kindness… Planning and decorating their wedding was a true pleasure!</p>",
 quote="Alexandra is our gem ♥️ We contacted her for the full planning of our wedding on 10/07/2021. We met and it was obvious, a real emotional and intellectual crush; by the end of the meeting we knew she was the one! We lived in Lille and wanted to marry in my home region of Bordeaux. We started working together before Covid, and that complicated period was never a problem thanks to Alexandra!! Planning, decor, coordination: she did it all! With her there are never problems, only solutions! As a bonus, she reassured us when we needed it, motivated us when necessary and, above all, gave us the wedding of our dreams, because Alexandra is a magician of love!! ♥️ Kind, gentle, understanding, reassuring, organised, professional, fair, full of creativity, skilful hands, a heart of gold… the list goes on, but I'll let you discover it, because with her your wedding will be unforgettable!!"),
}

